			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Split monolithic IPC handlers into modular domain structure\n\nBreak up the 167KB WindServiceHandlers.rs into domain-specific modules:\n- Commands, Configuration, Extensions, FileSystem, Model, NativeHost\n- Navigation, Output, Search, Storage, Terminal, UI, Utilities\n\nSimilarly refactor CocoonService/mod.rs from a 2800-line monolithic impl to delegate to domain modules:\n- Auth, Command, Debug, Extension, FileSystem, Initialization\n- Output, Provider, Save, SCM, Secret, Task, Terminal\n- TreeView, Window, Workspace\n\nEach domain module now owns its specific RPCs, improving maintainability and enabling parallel development on different handler domains. The dispatch remains a thin one-line delegate per typed RPC.",
			"SHA": "346842c23cbf13208a7afc941aad7ae08f4f301a"
		},
